# Lumberyard: makes fuel (wood) from the trees within the harvest radius around it. It stands anywhere: its yield
# is fixed at placement. No field, no light use.
Prefab gameLumberyard
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.45 0.3 0.15
		Scale 2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 2 2
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 2
